  "source": "pret/pokered data/trainers/parties.asm (Rival1Data, Rival2Data, Rival3Data)",
  "note": "Parties are in file order. The note on each party is the location comment from parties.asm. Within most locations the parties come in groups that differ only in the rival starter line (for example SQUIRTLE / BULBASAUR / CHARMANDER in Rival1, and their evolutions later). No starter choice text is written in parties.asm itself, so no choice wording has been added - the difference is shown by the species in the data. Rival1's first three parties have no location comment in the file (they come before the Route 22 comment) and their note is null.",
  "engine_special_moves_note": "Separate from special_moves.asm: engine/battle/read_trainer_party.asm gives the Champion (RIVAL3) party Pidgeot SKY_ATTACK as its 3rd move, and gives the 6th party member (the starter) FIRE_BLAST, BLIZZARD or MEGA_DRAIN depending on wRivalStarter. These are not recorded as extra_moves above because which starter move applies depends on the game state, not on the party data alone.",
